wer yours while a terrible  and savage looking thing the heart has a  peculiar beauty to it and you can also  talk to bloody finger hunter yura who  will let you know  the heart you brought back  it's used in dragon communion if you  should find yourself overcome by hunger  for the heart  yearning for its strength  then seek the decrepit church  on the little island of the western  coast  so after defeating a demi-human chief  boss you can make your way over to the  church of dragon communion here if you  have the dragon heart you can perform  dragon communion which by doing so will  let you receive grail's roar an  incantation of the dragon communion used  by those who've eaten of a dragon heart  manifest the power of the great ancient  dragon rail to sound a fearsome roar the  roar of the great grail foreboding as a  mountain overcomes all who hear it with  its might their attack power is  temporarily decreased  i can't wait to see what else you can  get through the dragon communion  you must not forget though  those who partake in dragon communion  will one day shed their humanity  their hunger for dragon  their yearning  only worsens  until the floodgates burst  unleashing eternal torment  the strength of a mighty dragon  magnificent  but deadly it's no surprise that dragon  communion  is ruinous  on the eastern side of elder ring storm  hill is a statue with something glowing  inside in order to get to his inner  goodies players will need to aggro one  of the nearby giants and allow the giant  to break the statue for you in the  network test inside of the statue were  six smithing stone shards  nice  the last secret i found and one i  personally didn't get to see through to  the end  near agile lake north there's a hidden  npc bach will call out to you boy  you you there  could you help us out kelly  if you have trouble finding bach call  lament you  yeah you there  stop pretending you can't see me  why won't anyone look me in the eye  i'm i'm not that ugly am 